1
00:00:00,642 --> 00:00:04,602
(Sheldon:)I'm confused. Was there
some sort of peer-review committee...

2
00:00:04,771 --> 00:00:07,111
(Sheldon:)...to determine which scientists
would be included?

3
00:00:07,274 --> 00:00:10,984
(Raj:)Peer review? It's People magazine.
People picked me.

4
00:00:11,445 --> 00:00:14,235
- What people?
- The people from People.

5
00:00:14,406 --> 00:00:16,826
What? Yeah, but exactly
who are these people?

6
00:00:16,992 --> 00:00:19,662
What are their credentials?
How are they qualified?

7
00:00:19,828 --> 00:00:22,248
(Sheldon:)What makes accidentally noticing
a hunk of rock...

8
00:00:22,414 --> 00:00:25,294
(Sheldon:)...that's been traipsing around
the solar system for billions of years...

9
00:00:25,459 --> 00:00:30,209
(Sheldon:)...more noteworthy than any other scientific
accomplishment by someone under 30?

10
00:00:30,672 --> 00:00:34,132
Boy, I bet Ellen Page's friends
aren't giving her this kind of crap.

11
00:00:39,556 --> 00:00:40,686
(Leonard:)You proud of yourself?

12
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:44,020
(Sheldon:)In general, yes.

